6031:./orchestration/tickets/W3a-status-systemb/plan-review.out:6135:orchestration/tickets/T19-e2e-flows-b/codex-impl-review-raw.txt:9145:[test_e30/279-284, test_e31/356-358] Dispatcher tick report checks are weakened. They do not assert the pinned 5-key shape, empty `reclaimed`/`timed_out`/`spawn_failed`, or fake spawn `pid`. Why: `run_tick` returns pinned keys (src/planner/dispatch/runtime.py:123-133), spawn entries include `pid` (runtime.py:197-199), and the fake adapter’s first pid is `90001` (src/planner/core/adapters/fakes.py:18, 27-33). Fix: assert `set(rep)`, the three empty lists, `skipped is None`, one spawned row with `ticket_id`, truthy `run_id`, and `pid == 90001`.
